 "answer_verbatim": "A reasonable starting point is **American Construction Inc.** BBB lists it as serving Joplin and nearby areas, with an **A+ rating**; it handles general construction and home-building work. Call **(417) 781-6811**.\n\nFor a smaller repair or handyman job, **Shere’s Construction & Handyman** is also listed by BBB as serving Joplin, with an **A+ rating**: **(417) 385-8899**. For kitchen or bathroom remodeling, **Top Tier Kitchens & Baths** serves Joplin and has customer reviews describing renovation work; call **(417) 887-1100**.\n\nBBB ratings are one screening signal, not a guarantee. Before hiring, get at least three written bids, ask for recent local references and proof of insurance, and make sure the contract spells out scope, materials, payment schedule, and change-order terms.",
